{"unit_id":"bingaha__dsh-live-mcp#card-zh","repo":"bingaha/dsh-live-mcp","commit":"999c943ca589f4fbc52ac065a6e94fd448f7b491","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-live-mcp 是面向 DSH Web GUI 的技能与 MCP 管理插件。它在设置页提供技能和 MCP 管理界面，并在会话输入框上方展示能力状态条；启用 MCP 服务器后建立真实连接并将工具注册给模型，也可按会话切换 MCP。技能可浏览、导入、查看调用策略和删除，MCP 可创建、测试、编辑、启停及删除，并设置工作区新会话默认值。适合希望在 DSH Web 中管理本地技能目录和按对话选择 MCP 工具的用户。需要 Node.js 22.19 或更高兼容版本及本地 DSH 环境，不需要插件自有 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:61-85","src/mcp.ts:21-45","src/skills.ts:31-38","src/client/index.ts:48-67"]}
{"unit_id":"bingaha__dsh-live-mcp#card-en","repo":"bingaha/dsh-live-mcp","commit":"999c943ca589f4fbc52ac065a6e94fd448f7b491","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-live-mcp adds skills and MCP management to the DSH Web GUI. Users can import local skills, connect MCP servers, and select tools per conversation. The settings page supports connection checks and workspace defaults for new conversations. It requires DSH and Node.js 22.19 or newer.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:61-85","src/mcp.ts:21-45","src/skills.ts:31-38","src/client/index.ts:48-67"]}
